---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service · NicheDomainRadar">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 font-mono leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: August 13, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By accessing NicheDomainRadar, you agree to comply with these Terms of Service. Our services provide curated expired domain analytics and registrar availability links.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">2. Pro Subscription & License Keys</h2>
      <p>Pro memberships are billed on a recurring monthly basis. Each License Key grants non-exclusive access to unmasked domain feeds and direct registrar links for personal or business use.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">3. Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>Domain registration status is verified in real-time via ICANN RDAP protocols. However, third-party registrar availability can change rapidly. We are not responsible for domain registration disputes with third-party registrars.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">4. Support & Refunds</h2>
      <p>For subscription changes or billing support, contact: <a href="mailto:support@nichedomainradar.com" class="text-emerald-400 underline">support@nichedomainradar.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
